00:07:54.345 --> 00:08:04.420
Everybody understands the aging baby boomers. We've been talking about this for thirty years that we needed to plan for the aging population. The baby boom generation is getting older and older.

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:09.460
So as you can see on this chart, I can't read it, but I think it's 1970.

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:11.460
