00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:16.820
was 28. That was when all of you were coming to Andover and building houses.

00:08:17.375 --> 00:08:24.895
The median age is half of the people are above that and half of the people are below that. So '28 was the median in 1970.

00:08:25.055 --> 00:08:32.255
You have now grown all the way up to twenty twenty to, I believe it says 44 or 48 is the median population.

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:39.500
So half are above, half are below 48 now. That is very significant. 43%

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:40.780
of your population

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.780
in 2020

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:45.580
was 50 years old. So in ten years,

00:08:46.285 --> 00:08:47.085
probably

00:08:47.085 --> 00:08:51.725
half of your population with the aging population and younger people moving out,

00:08:51.965 --> 00:08:59.725
probably half of your population will be 60 years old. So you're going to have a lot of people that are probably starting to struggle

