00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:38.630
this is not unusual for every small town in Connecticut.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:44.070
The number of permits being issued for each year for new homes is down significantly.

00:09:44.615 --> 00:09:46.215
So from prior

00:09:46.535 --> 00:09:47.495
to 2010,

00:09:47.495 --> 00:09:50.775
