00:09:54.215 --> 00:09:59.980
the big one was the Haverhill subdivision on Long Hill Road. That's when they came in and they said, okay, we're going to divide

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:02.140
the land and we're going to build houses.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:05.420
Completely on speculation, they didn't have contracts.

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:09.500
