00:11:12.605 --> 00:11:16.765
gs goal of 10% of your housing stock being affordable.

00:11:17.085 --> 00:11:23.085
So you need 82 more units to be of additional affordable units to meet that 10%.

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:29.100
The statute requires that every project have 30%

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:31.740
