00:11:45.795 --> 00:11:49.715
of them being market rate and 82 of them being affordable.

00:11:50.115 --> 00:12:00.370
All you have to do is go back and look and see what the market is supporting for the last twelve years, three to five units a year. You're not going to get two seventy three housing units in a very, very long time.

